eBreakColor\\u0022:\\u0022#066aab\\u0022,\\u0022containerPadding\\u0022:\\u00220px\\u0022,\\u0022containerBorderStyle\\u0022:\\u0022none\\u0022,\\u0022containerBorderWidth\\u0022:\\u00221px\\u0022,\\u0022containerBorderColor\\u0022:\\u0022#000000\\u0022,\\u0022containerBorderRadius\\u0022:\\u00223px\\u0022,\\u0022containerShadowSize\\u0022:\\u0022none\\u0022,\\u0022customCss\\u0022:\\u0022\\u0022}\"} /-->', 'Contact Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '163-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-05-18 17:02:37', '2025-05-18 17:02:37', '', 163, 'http://localhost:8888/tinfox/?p=171', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(172, 1, '2025-05-18 17:07:00', '2025-05-18 17:07:00', '<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":112,\"mediaLink\":\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/undraw_android_vygj/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/undraw_android_vygj.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-112 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Android App Development</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Elevate Your Business with a Cutting-Edge Android App!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Content…\"} -->\n<p>Combine <strong>innovation and expertise</strong> to build high-impact Android apps that engage users and deliver results. Using the latest <strong>Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and Flutter</strong>, we create fast, scalable, and visually stunning apps tailored to your brand. Whether you need an <strong>MVP, enterprise solution, or AI-powered app</strong>, our end-to-end development ensures seamless performance and security. Short, powerful, and compelling—ready to impress! Need any tweaks?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaPosition\":\"right\",\"mediaId\":121,\"mediaLink\":\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/undraw_mobile-images_b202/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">iOS App Development </h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Power Your Brand with a Premium iOS App!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Blend <strong>precision and innovation</strong> to craft high-performance iOS apps that captivate users and drive growth. Leveraging <strong>Swift, SwiftUI, and cutting-edge technologies</strong>, we build sleek, scalable apps with flawless performance. From <strong>MVP to enterprise solutions</strong>, we deliver secure, App Store-ready experiences tailored to your vision. Crisp, compelling, and results-driven—ready to elevate your mobile presence! Need refinements?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Content…\"} -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/undraw_mobile-images_b202.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-121 size-full\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":120,\"mediaLink\":\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/undraw_web-development_0wdh/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/undraw_web-development_0wdh.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-120 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Backend Development</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Engineered for Scale, Built for Performance</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your app deserves a powerhouse backend. We architect <strong>high-availability systems</strong> using <strong>Node.js, Python, Go, and cloud-native stacks</strong> that handle millions of requests effortlessly. From <strong>RESTful APIs to real-time microservices</strong>, we build secure, scalable backends with <strong>AWS/GCP, Kubernetes, and serverless</strong>—ensuring 24/7 reliability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>For startups to enterprises—backend excellence, delivered.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaPosition\":\"right\",\"mediaId\":118,\"mediaLink\":\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/undraw_progressive-app_9517/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cross-platform Development</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Code Once, Dominate Every Platform</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Why choose between platforms when you can conquer them all? We craft <strong>high-performance cross-platform apps</strong> using <strong>Flutter &amp; React Native</strong> that deliver native-like speed and UX on iOS, Android, and web. Our lean development approach saves <strong>50% time and cost</strong> without compromising quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From MVPs to enterprise solutions - we build future-proof apps that perform everywhere.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/undraw_progressive-app_9517.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-118 size-full\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":114,\"mediaLink\":\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/undraw_maintenance_rjtm/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/undraw_maintenance_rjtm.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-114 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">App Maintenance</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Keep Your App Running Like New – Always</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even the best apps need care. We provide <strong>proactive app maintenance</strong> to ensure peak performance, security, and compatibility with every update. From <strong>bug fixes to OS upgrades, performance tuning to emergency support</strong>, we\'ve got you covered 24/7.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Never let technical debt slow you down.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaPosition\":\"right\",\"mediaId\":119,\"mediaLink\":\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/undraw_wordpress_l75e/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Wordpress Website Development</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Power Your Online Presence with WordPress Excellence</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Turn your vision into a stunning, high-performance website with our expert&nbsp;<strong>WordPress development</strong>services. We create&nbsp;<strong>fast, secure, and scalable</strong>&nbsp;websites—from sleek portfolios to powerful e-commerce stores—using custom themes, plugins, and optimized hosting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>SEO-friendly, mobile-ready, and built to convert.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/undraw_wordpress_l75e.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-119 size-full\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->', 'Services', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'services', '', '', '2025-05-20 11:46:49', '2025-05-20 11:46:49', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8888/tinfox/?page_id=172', 0, 'page', '', 0),
