!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Blend <strong>precision and innovation</strong> to craft high-performance iOS apps that captivate users and drive growth. Leveraging <strong>Swift, SwiftUI, and cutting-edge technologies</strong>, we build sleek, scalable apps with flawless performance. From <strong>MVP to enterprise solutions</strong>, we deliver secure, App Store-ready experiences tailored to your vision. Crisp, compelling, and results-driven—ready to elevate your mobile presence! Need refinements?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":121,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/undraw_mobile-images_b202.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-121\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":177,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/undraw_brainstorming_gny9-2-1024x609.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-177\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Backend Development</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Engineered for Scale, Built for Performance</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your app deserves a powerhouse backend. We architect <strong>high-availability systems</strong> using <strong>Node.js, Python, Go, and cloud-native stacks</strong> that handle millions of requests effortlessly. From <strong>RESTful APIs to real-time microservices</strong>, we build secure, scalable backends with <strong>AWS/GCP, Kubernetes, and serverless</strong>—ensuring 24/7 reliability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>For startups to enterprises—backend excellence, delivered.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Cross-platform Development</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Code Once, Dominate Every Platform</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Why choose between platforms when you can conquer them all? We craft <strong>high-performance cross-platform apps</strong> using <strong>Flutter &amp; React Native</strong> that deliver native-like speed and UX on iOS, Android, and web. Our lean development approach saves <strong>50% time and cost</strong> without compromising quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From MVPs to enterprise solutions - we build future-proof apps that perform everywhere.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":118,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/undraw_progressive-app_9517.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-118\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":177,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/tinfox/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/undraw_brainstorming_gny9-2-1024x609.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-177\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">App Maintenance</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Keep Your App Running Like New – Always</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even the best apps need care. We provide <strong>proactive app maintenance</strong> to ensure peak performance, security, and compatibility with every update. From <strong>bug fixes to OS upgrades, performance tuning to emergency support</strong>, we\'ve got you covered 24/7.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Never let technical debt slow you down.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->', 'Services', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '172-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-05-20 11:18:00', '2025-05-20 11:18:00', '', 172, 'http://localhost:8888/tinfox/?p=210', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
